{"id":"02-kafeet","level":"A1","title":{"sv":"På kaféet","en":"At the café","zh":"在咖啡馆"},"scene":{"en":"Li orders a coffee and a cinnamon bun.","zh":"Li 点一杯咖啡和一个肉桂卷。"},"vocab":[{"sv":"kanelbulle","en":"cinnamon bun","zh":"肉桂卷"},{"sv":"Swish","en":"Swedish mobile payment app","zh":"瑞典手机支付应用"},{"sv":"det är bra så","en":"that's all, thanks","zh":"这样就好（不用别的了）"}],"lines":[{"who":"Barista","sv":"Hej! Vad vill du ha?","en":"Hi! What would you like?","zh":"你好！你想要什么？","tokens":[{"t":"Hej","id":1162},{"t":"! "},{"t":"Vad","id":147},{"t":" "},{"t":"vill","id":129},{"t":" "},{"t":"du","id":134},{"t":" "},{"t":"ha","id":90},{"t":"?"}],"note":{"en":"“Vad vill du ha?” is what you will hear in every café and shop.","zh":"“Vad vill du ha?” 在所有咖啡馆和商店都会听到。"}},{"who":"Li","sv":"Hej! En kaffe, tack.","en":"Hi! A coffee, please.","zh":"你好！一杯咖啡，谢谢。","tokens":[{"t":"Hej","id":1162},{"t":"! "},{"t":"En","id":93},{"t":" "},{"t":"kaffe","id":1944},{"t":", "},{"t":"tack","id":903},{"t":"."}],"note":{"en":"Swedish has no word for “please”; you add “tack” (thanks) at the end instead.","zh":"瑞典语没有“请”这个词，用句尾的“tack”代替。"}},{"who":"Barista","sv":"Vill du ha en stor eller en liten?","en":"Would you like a large or a small one?","zh":"你要大杯还是小杯？","tokens":[{"t":"Vill","id":129},{"t":" "},{"t":"du","id":134},{"t":" "},{"t":"ha","id":90},{"t":" "},{"t":"en","id":93},{"t":" "},{"t":"stor","id":142},{"t":" "},{"t":"eller","id":126},{"t":" "},{"t":"en","id":93},{"t":" "},{"t":"liten","id":106},{"t":"?"}]},{"who":"Li","sv":"En stor, tack. Och en kanelbulle.","en":"A large one, please. And a cinnamon bun.","zh":"大杯，谢谢。再来一个肉桂卷。","tokens":[{"t":"En","id":93},{"t":" "},{"t":"stor","id":142},{"t":", "},{"t":"tack","id":903},{"t":". "},{"t":"Och","id":87},{"t":" "},{"t":"en","id":93},{"t":" "},{"t":"kanelbulle","v":"kanelbulle"},{"t":"."}]},{"who":"Barista","sv":"Något mer?","en":"Anything else?","zh":"还要别的吗？","tokens":[{"t":"Något","id":135},{"t":" "},{"t":"mer","id":90003},{"t":"?"}]},{"who":"Li","sv":"Nej tack,